    "text": "Doing another Dragon fight!!! \nHow this will work- I will be designing another dragon soonish, and then you guys vote on who would win in a fight between the two, shortly after I tally your votes, I draw the winning dragon ripping apart the loser \n\nThorn:\n• Thrives in close quarters combat, a brawler, he gets in close quarters with an opponent and keeps them close.\n• Exoskeleton is lined with brittle serrated shards, these shards are designed to break off into an opponent during combat.\n• Shards expand slightly when impaled, making them very difficult to remove, sometimes even causing more damage when extracted. (think dog after discovering a porcupine for the first time)\n• Does not have any breath attack/but Thorn's luminescent blood and saliva contains incredibly aggressive bacteria strains- a single puncture or scratch from this dragon leads to immediate degrading effects.  \n• No flight capabilities, but very quick, agile and stealthy.\n\nThorns opponent dragon coming soon! \n\nLast round:",
